flowchart TD
    input["Read input with an explicit source kind"] --> kind{"What was supplied?"}
    kind -->|Decimal text or fraction| rational["Parse sign, digits, and exponent or numerator and denominator"]
    rational --> retain["Retain exact rational data or a justified enclosure"]
    kind -->|Integer| integer["Capture exactly before any conversion to a component float"]
    integer --> retain
    kind -->|Existing binary float| binary["Capture the already-rounded binary value exactly"]
    binary --> retain
    kind -->|Pair or base plus correction| dyadic["Decode both words as exact dyadics, or keep the two source operands"]
    dyadic --> retain
    kind -->|Complex| components["Apply the same input rules to real and imaginary parts"]
    components --> retain
    retain --> check{"Valid syntax, supported source size, and allowed numeric class?"}
    check -->|No| sourceerror["Return the appropriate input, size, or domain error"]
    check -->|Yes| split["Split into a normalized pair using the output rounding procedure"]
    split --> fits{"Exact, or within the input error budget?"}
    fits -->|Yes| keep["Keep the pair and retain original data for any required retry"]
    fits -->|No| wider["Keep a wider representation if allowed, or report input loss"]
    keep --> compute["Pass the preserved value into the computation"]
    wider -->|Wider value available| compute
